l_english:
 # Roman Praetorian Prefectures
 game_concept_irtock3_praetorian_prefecture: "Praetorian Prefecture"
 game_concept_irtock3_praetorian_prefectures: "Praetorian Prefectures"
 game_concept_irtock3_praetorian_prefecture_desc: "IRToCK3 divides the map into various regions, mimicking Rome's $game_concept_irtock3_praetorian_prefectures$. While some of these regions are based on Rome's historical Prefectures, others were made based off how it seems the Romans viewed the world (or may have, for the further regions). Depending on what mods are being used, these regions may change to better fit the map.\n\nIf [GetTitleByKey('h_roman_empire').GetName], [GetTitleByKey('e_western_roman_empire').GetName] or [GetTitleByKey('e_byzantium').GetName] exist at game start, or when the [GetDecisionWithKey('irtock3_elevate_roman_empire_decision').GetName] [decision|E] is taken, Rome's [de_jure|E] land is separated based off these regions.\n\nThe following regions exist:\n$irtock3_praetorian_prefecture_region_list$"
 ## List of Prefecture regions (can change based off mods)
